# Production env consumed by `vite build`. Sets the runtime
# API base baked into the SPA bundle (read at src/lib/config.ts:33).
# #175 (CT-1 2026-09-08) -- SAME-ORIGIN. The URL map routes
# clarity.pro-mediations.com/api/* to clarity-engine with pathPrefixRewrite /
# (clarityos-web-map.404fix.yaml), so the SPA calls /api and the browser
# sends no CORS preflight (18 of 89 requests in the 09-04 HAR were OPTIONS).
# The run.app origin stays valid for the embed path (window.CLARITYOS_API_BASE).
VITE_API_BASE=/api
